WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.480
In all the chronicles of the ages, never before has any nation celebrated so magnificent a

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.060
triumph as this one.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.780
We are the freest people on earth.

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:19.080
And by the grace of God, the United States of America is the most successful, most accomplished,

00:00:19.540 --> 00:00:24.340
most exceptional nation ever to exist in human history.

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:34.340
Liberty has prevailed here because of the culture and character of the people who declared it, defended it, and preserved it.

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:47.280
We reach a milestone like no other and celebrate with joyful hearts and soaring spirits because after two and a half centuries, we know that this is not an ending.

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:53.240
This is only the beginning of the golden age of America.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.240
God bless you all.
